    "body": "### Expected behavior and actual behavior:\r\nAfter upgrade from 3.10.6 to 3.11.0, Record.update() doesn't work with connections from jdbc data source.\r\n\r\n### Steps to reproduce the problem (include example code if possible):\r\n```java\r\nDSLContext context = DSL.using(dataSource, SQLDialect.POSTGRES_9_5);\r\nUsersRecord user = context.selectFrom(USERS).where(USERS.ID.eq(1)).fetchOne();\r\nuser.setFirstName(\"test\");\r\nuser.update();\r\n```\r\n\r\n```\r\norg.jooq.exception.DataAccessException: SQL [update \"core\".\"users\" set \"first_name\" = ? where \"core\".\"users\".\"id\" = ?]; Connection is closed\r\n\tat org.jooq_3.11.0.POSTGRES_9_5.debug(Unknown Source)\r\n\tat org.jooq.impl.Tools.translate(Tools.java:2380)\r\n\tat org.jooq.impl.DefaultExecuteContext.sqlException(DefaultExecuteContext.java:737)\r\n\tat org.jooq.impl.AbstractQuery.execute(AbstractQuery.java:364)\r\n\tat org.jooq.impl.UpdatableRecordImpl.storeUpdate0(UpdatableRecordImpl.java:253)\r\n\tat org.jooq.impl.UpdatableRecordImpl.access$100(UpdatableRecordImpl.java:84)\r\n\tat org.jooq.impl.UpdatableRecordImpl$2.operate(UpdatableRecordImpl.java:209)\r\n\tat org.jooq.impl.RecordDelegate.operate(RecordDelegate.java:125)\r\n\tat org.jooq.impl.UpdatableRecordImpl.storeUpdate(UpdatableRecordImpl.java:205)\r\n\tat org.jooq.impl.UpdatableRecordImpl.update(UpdatableRecordImpl.java:155)\r\n\tat org.jooq.impl.UpdatableRecordImpl.update(UpdatableRecordImpl.java:150)\r\n\t....\r\nCaused by: java.sql.SQLException: Connection is closed\r\n\tat com.zaxxer.hikari.pool.ProxyConnection$ClosedConnection.lambda$getClosedConnection$0(ProxyConnection.java:489)\r\n\tat com.zaxxer.hikari.pool.ProxyConnection$ClosedConnection$$Lambda$2170/824175404.invoke(Unknown Source)\r\n\tat com.sun.proxy.$Proxy157.prepareStatement(Unknown Source)\r\n\tat com.zaxxer.hikari.pool.ProxyConnection.prepareStatement(ProxyConnection.java:311)\r\n\tat com.zaxxer.hikari.pool.HikariProxyConnection.prepareStatement(HikariProxyConnection.java)\r\n\tat org.jooq.impl.ProviderEnabledConnection.prepareStatement(ProviderEnabledConnection.java:109)\r\n\tat org.jooq.impl.SettingsEnabledConnection.prepareStatement(SettingsEnabledConnection.java:73)\r\n\tat org.jooq.impl.ProviderEnabledConnection.prepareStatement(ProviderEnabledConnection.java:109)\r\n\tat org.jooq.impl.SettingsEnabledConnection.prepareStatement(SettingsEnabledConnection.java:73)\r\n\tat org.jooq.impl.AbstractQuery.prepare(AbstractQuery.java:416)\r\n\tat org.jooq.impl.AbstractDMLQuery.prepare(AbstractDMLQuery.java:511)\r\n\tat org.jooq.impl.AbstractQuery.execute(AbstractQuery.java:322)\r\n```\r\n\r\n### Versions:\r\n\r\n- jOOQ: 3.11.0\r\n- Java: 1.8\r\n- Database (include vendor): PostgreSQL 9.6\r\n- OS: Windows 10\r\n- JDBC Driver (include name if inofficial driver): 42.2.2\r\n",
